T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 Elevation to administrative rights follows the rules defined in SOP SEC-091.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 Administrative sessions on production hosts are logged by the bastion service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Onboarding) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.1 New joiners are granted access once their manager confirms their start date and the data) Tj
T*
(owner approves the request.) Tj
